      "id": "weekly-upstream-20261101",
      "notes": "Add native async throwing apiKeyProvider; resolve a fresh key immediately before every authenticated HTTP send/stream through the shared transport. Preserve static keys, custom header precedence, error/abort propagation, request builders and response parsers. TypeScript Resolvable/promise/function declarations map to an optional Sendable async closure. No other portable wire/runtime change was found in the published delta. Reviewed upstream: @ai-sdk/typesafe-ai 3.0.27 to 3.0.31. Validation passed: node Scripts/test-packages.mjs (all 52 owning package suites and the compatibility facade); node Scripts/sdk.mjs generate --check; node --test Scripts/tests/*.test.cjs (27 passed); docs-site check and build (100 pages). Live provider calls were not run.",
      "compatibility": "Minor release for additive native API; existing static settings and call sites remain compatible. Updated direct dependency minimums are recorded in the manifest. Existing documented JS/framework and native product gaps remain; version-delta review does not imply full parity or live-service testing. Explicit custom authentication skips an unused credential supplier, a deliberate native callback-order adaptation."
    }
  ],
